{"parentUuid":"f0fa5250-d763-451b-9299-e8c296c66120","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1aa1a67f-cc4a-49b5-9b55-04ec3c1fcd6d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UnhjgcZB17oQFXBz1Gj98Z","type":"tool_result","content":"=== today's commit files:\n AGENTS.md                                 |   2 +\n docs/program/README_DATA.md               |  14 +\n docs/program/coaches-playbook.md          | 619 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n docs/program/external-research-summary.md | 160 ++++++++\n 4 files changed, 795 insertions(+)\n\n=== AGENTS.md (first 40 lines):\n# AGENTS.md\n\nProject: S2_Evaluation\n\n\n## Session routine\n- Start: run `git pull`, then read docs/STATUS.md before doing anything else.\n- End: update docs/STATUS.md (done, next, open questions), commit, and `git push`.\n- Never leave uncommitted work at the end of a session.\n\n## Source of truth\n\nThis folder is the source of truth for S2 Cognition work. The Claude cloud project\n\"S2 Cognition\" is only a pointer to here. Durable notes go in `docs/` and get\ncommitted.\n\n## Read first\n\n| Doc | When |\n|---|---|\n| `CONTEXT.md` | Always. Project language and the Beyond Percentiles framing. |\n| `docs/STATUS.md` | Always, at session start. |\n| `docs/program/executive-report.md` | Team-wide and position-group findings, 2021-2024, with benchmarks and flagged players. |\n| `docs/program/analysis-strategy.md` | Planning an analysis or a coach-facing report. Includes the translate-to-football-language table. |\n| `docs/program/implementation-plan.md` | Rolling out to staff: the 8-week, five-phase plan. |\n| `docs/program/literature-review.md` | Background on the nine skills, validation research, position benchmarks, LSU and C.J. Stroud case studies. |\n| `docs/program/citations-and-data-sources.md` | Sourcing a claim, or checking a known limitation of the dataset. |\n| `docs/program/coaches-playbook.md` | Prescribing a drill for a cognitive weakness. S2's position-by-position quick fixes and drill concepts. |\n| `docs/program/external-research-summary.md` | Short version of the outside research, including the LSU numbers and position thresholds. |\n| `docs/adr/` | Why a methodological decision was made. Read before relitigating one. |\n\n## Where related work lives\n\n- `COG_S2_Position_Reports/` in `~/DEV` holds the per-position S2 report PDFs.\n- `data/` here is gitignored and holds athlete-level scores.\n- Deliverables go to `00_Primary_Storage_Drive` on Google Drive, not into this repo.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Never overwrite an existing file. Create a new one.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"49c1519e-53d5-4018-ad8f-5b859a37ccab","timestamp":"2026-09-12T04:12:34.567Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== today's commit files:\n AGENTS.md                                 |   2 +\n docs/program/README_DATA.md               |  14 +\n docs/program/coaches-playbook.md          | 619 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n docs/program/external-research-summary.md | 160 ++++++++\n 4 files changed, 795 insertions(+)\n\n=== AGENTS.md (first 40 lines):\n# AGENTS.md\n\nProject: S2_Evaluation\n\n\n## Session routine\n- Start: run `git pull`, then read docs/STATUS.md before doing anything else.\n- End: update docs/STATUS.md (done, next, open questions), commit, and `git push`.\n- Never leave uncommitted work at the end of a session.\n\n## Source of truth\n\nThis folder is the source of truth for S2 Cognition work. The Claude cloud project\n\"S2 Cognition\" is only a pointer to here. Durable notes go in `docs/` and get\ncommitted.\n\n## Read first\n\n| Doc | When |\n|---|---|\n| `CONTEXT.md` | Always. Project language and the Beyond Percentiles framing. |\n| `docs/STATUS.md` | Always, at session start. |\n| `docs/program/executive-report.md` | Team-wide and position-group findings, 2021-2024, with benchmarks and flagged players. |\n| `docs/program/analysis-strategy.md` | Planning an analysis or a coach-facing report. Includes the translate-to-football-language table. |\n| `docs/program/implementation-plan.md` | Rolling out to staff: the 8-week, five-phase plan. |\n| `docs/program/literature-review.md` | Background on the nine skills, validation research, position benchmarks, LSU and C.J. Stroud case studies. |\n| `docs/program/citations-and-data-sources.md` | Sourcing a claim, or checking a known limitation of the dataset. |\n| `docs/program/coaches-playbook.md` | Prescribing a drill for a cognitive weakness. S2's position-by-position quick fixes and drill concepts. |\n| `docs/program/external-research-summary.md` | Short version of the outside research, including the LSU numbers and position thresholds. |\n| `docs/adr/` | Why a methodological decision was made. Read before relitigating one. |\n\n## Where related work lives\n\n- `COG_S2_Position_Reports/` in `~/DEV` holds the per-position S2 report PDFs.\n- `data/` here is gitignored and holds athlete-level scores.\n- Deliverables go to `00_Primary_Storage_Drive` on Google Drive, not into this repo.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Never overwrite an existing file. Create a new one.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f0fa5250-d763-451b-9299-e8c296c66120","session_id":"5f787bd2-5516-4b7b-83f9-acd31011325f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/skills","sessionId":"ca9f8ae1-3064-4ead-9a52-e1c579c0f997","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main","sessionKind":"bg"}
